{"seq":18,"trial_id":"gbrain-ladder-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-told-mu-heldout/sc-04-strategic-pod-corrections/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-25T00:29:21.319Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"2de3e5a77ef3cd8ce5d2bebc14ae08f34f176949ed770c0b04a7277149bf26c5","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#strategic-pod","text":"@June Osei-Lark: Gideon closed ticket #8841 with support on 1 Jul (his 09:17 post). The fix was IT clearing a browser cache issue on the kiosk tablets, after which the standard Detention Summary template worked for their billing dept, so no custom CSV export was needed. Separately, a 30 Sep account digest links #8841 to a Door 14 kiosk escalation for the Newark check-in. That doesn't match the 1 Jul post, so the ticket may have been reused or the digest may be wrong. Worth checking the ticket record.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000129"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000130","thread_ts":"1791986400.000129"}}
